# Scene 2: the address row takes each page's colour. Two pinned rows, two colours:
# Django's green header, then PyPI's blue one (Django's row at y = 210, PyPI's at
# y = 255). The pointer then goes back to the sidebar's ground, so it
# rests over no row of the Space the next scene goes to (a hover card would open).
shot @MARKS@/colour.png
glide 150 210 0.45
click 150 210
wait 1.3
glide 150 255 0.4
click 150 255
wait 1.3
glide 150 720 0.4
